  "description": "Asks how IsNull, Nz, Len, &, +, IIf and comparison treat stored Null, empty-text and padded-text values: over the five rows of Mx (N Long, T Text with a Null, an empty and a padded value, D Double, DT Date, Y Yes/No), the projections IsNull/Nz/Nz-with-replacement/Len/VarType of N and T, the & and + forms with a stored Null, an IIf classification, and Nz of a Double replaced by a Long. Then Nz called with no arguments and with three. Fixture r-expr-1b-main is opened read-only through DAO.DBEngine.120; engine version and the loaded modules (once) are recorded; each recordset reads Name, Type and Value of every field.",
